 /**
+ * struct hy310_lamp - the lamp's dimmer, where the board hands it to us
+ * @pwm:        PWM device "bl0"
+ * @period_ns:  PWM period (bl0/dft_period_ns, else the fans' pwm_period_ns)
+ * @duty_array: duty in percent per mode, the same index as the fans'
+ *              duty-array-policy1
+ * @num_modes:  entries in @duty_array
+ * @names:      lamp-mode-names: the modes a user may choose, by index
+ * @num_names:  entries in @names
+ *
+ * The stock driver owns lamp and fan together, one mode index sets both
+ * (L018, fan_policy 1: bl0 duty-array 50/75/30/75 and fan0
+ * duty-array-policy1 70/60/95/70 for std/low/high and its thermal mode 3).
+ * A board without a bl0 node has no lamp here, and nothing changes for it.
+ */
